.TH XMUNIPACK  1 "June 2013" "Munipack" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
xmunipack \- graphical user interface for Munipack
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B xmunipack
.I [fits]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Munipack is a general astronomical image processing software.
Xmunipack provides a graphical user interface for selected features.
.PP
With no parameters, browser is opened.
.PP
Viewer is opened when a FITS file is provided.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
Print this help.
.TP
.B \-\-version
Print version and license.
